OL,3,AJapanese avant-garde artist Yayoi
OL,4,AKusama dies aged 97
OL,5,
OL,6,FJapanese avant-garde artist Yayoi
OL,7,FKusama, who became famous later in life
OL,8,Ffor her work in sculptures and
OL,9,Finstallations, has died aged 97, her
OL,10,Fcompany has confirmed.
OL,12,FThe statement announced, "with profound
OL,13,Fsorrow... the passing of Yayoi Kusama
OL,14,Fat a hospital in Tokyo on August 14,
OL,15,F2026, at the age of 97".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
