OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJapanese avant-garde artist Yayoi
OL,4,AKusama dies aged 97
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Throughout an extraordinary lifetime
OL,7,Fdevoted entirely to artistic creation,
OL,8,FKusama pursued an internationally
OL,9,Facclaimed career as a pioneering
OL,10,Favant-garde artist whose creative
OL,11,Fpractice encompassed visual art,
OL,12,Fperformance, fiction, and poetry," it
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FKusama, who had voluntarily lived in a
OL,16,Fpyschiatric hospital for decades, was
OL,17,Fknown for her bright-red wig and quirky
OL,18,Fpolka-dot ensembles.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
